WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.300
Yahoo!

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:46.310
No sooner do we arrive than the Blue come to greet us.

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:47.840
That was some pretty nice timing,

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:49.970
me jumping out of the crane like that, huh Yuji?

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:51.570
Uh, yeah.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.650
Joey, keep your eyes forward.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:55.510
Right, right.

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:58.320
Marlene...

00:02:58.390 --> 00:03:00.980
Were you able to identify that Blue?

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:04.320
Yes. Just as the data on the Korean zone said,

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:06.830
Their shape was that of the Springworm type.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:10.330
They lack the ability to fly, and their core is on the front of their head.

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:13.270
I want to avoid unnecessary battle...

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:16.400
Let's evade contact with the Blue as much as possible

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:19.340
and hurry to join up with the Seoul Recovery Squad.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:08.320
Dammit...

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:12.950
Marlene, there aren't any survivors, either from the Recovery Squad or the Sleepers.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:19.660
There's nothing left to do. We're pulling out.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.330
The Recovery Squad, along with the Sleepers, were all wiped out.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:25.340
We'll have to find another means of return.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.770
I see... Having come to this,

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:32.280
we now have to make contact with the station as soon as possible.

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:37.940
If we aren't able to report that we've survived, we'll be completely isolated...

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:40.650
If there's a communications facility equipped with satellite circuitry,

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:42.920
some kind of communication should be possible.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:46.550
We'd have to first secure a safe location, though.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:53.300
Joey, do you hear something?

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:53.890
Hm...?

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.680
People! There are people!

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:05.270
Stop! Joey, Stop!

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:08.810
Blue...

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:16.320
Yuji, pay no attention!

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:18.860
W- What are you talking about, Marlene!?

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:36.770
What the hell...!?

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:32.770
Take this!

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:47.650
Are you okay?

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:50.750
That was a close one, huh?

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:53.620
I'm Yuji. And you?

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:54.950
Y- Yung...

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:57.860
So, you're Yung, are you?

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:12.700
Marlene! Joey! Did you see that!? I took it down!

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:16.970
I thought I told you to pay no attention!

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:19.310
But I couldn't just leave her like that, could I?

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:22.510
The Blue will begin gathering here because of those gunshots!

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:27.320
Yuji, what you did has exposed all of us to danger!

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:32.330
l- I didn't mean to, I was just... Yung!

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:42.930
Damned Blue! Are they moving in already!?

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.730
Escaping out of this city just became harder.

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:53.170
Marlene, we have to find somewhere to hide ourselves before the Blue find us.

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:12.760
Seeing how that child was here, there has to be a safe place nearby...

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:16.300
There she is!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:36.080
We can't make it with the Armor Shrikes.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.590
Joey, park the trailer in that storehouse.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:46.430
Got it.

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:40.250
Joey, take him!

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:40.910
Huh?

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:43.490
Yuji!

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:59.940
All right! There's still this many people left alive!?

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:01.440
Thank goodness!

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:05.380
Your worries are over!

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:10.010
We're here now, you can relax! Okay? Okay? Okay?

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:23.020
W- what's the matter with all of you?

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:25.970
Yuji!

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:28.160
What are you doing!? Get back here!

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.140
Yung...

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:45.010
Yuji!

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:51.930
Aw, Yuji... What should we do, Marlene?

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:54.790
First thing we have to do is find somewhere to camp.

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:01.600
Yung, where did you go!?

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:13.870
What's this?

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.990
Yung!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.410
What does all this mean?

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:35.630
Yung, why do you run away from me?

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:39.570
I won't do anything! You don't have to run away from me, Yung!

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:43.030
Maru!

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:54.550
Maru... I get it, you're Maru, huh?

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:57.980
Okay, okay. You've done well to stay alive too.

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:06.660
Yung, don't go near this guy.

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:09.990
But this man helped Yung out.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:12.760
Yung, you've been told what kind of folks

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:15.670
the people from Second Earth are, haven't you?

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:19.640
These guys are sure to abandon the people on Earth once again someday.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:37.480
Why are you looking at me like that? Why...?

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:49.800
Robert, all the bridges have been destroyed.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:53.330
It appears the only way to cross is over that narrow scaffolding.

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:57.800
Here, in a place without any flying variety of Blue...

00:13:57.880 --> 00:14:02.510
it's the one place where, miraculously, humans have secured a place to live, then?

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:05.980
And even then, only on the condition that the humans' existence

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:07.920
isn't revealed to the Blue.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:10.980
Once revealed, it will no longer be safe here.

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:12.990
Mmm...

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.830
Yuji, where have you been until now!?

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:22.340
You have to know that unauthorized activity is forbidden!

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:28.340
I saw how the people here live.

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:31.740
What the hell did the people of Second Earth do to them!?

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:42.620
Why is it all the people here stare at me with such contemptuous looks!?

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:47.020
Say something, Marlene!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:54.790
In space, food stores and energy is greatly limited.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:15:00.310
As such, only a chosen handful of people was moved to Second Earth.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:01.860
From that time forward,

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:07.310
all plans have moved forward as if the humans left on Earth were already dead.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:11.320
Already dead!? What do you mean by that!?

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:15.850
It means that for us, someone's life or death has no bearing on the mission.

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:18.360
That even goes for children.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:23.660
These guys are sure to abandon the people on Earth once again someday.

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:26.960
Marlene, do you mean you've abandoned them!?

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:35.440
Get this straight! Marlene, I am not one of the people of Second Earth!

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:39.640
I will take whatever action I please, regardless of your permission!

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:51.280
...What the hell is happening here!?

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:55.260
How can Marlene say something so cold!?

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:02.870
Maru...

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:05.570
Yung...

00:16:06.370 --> 00:16:07.600
Here.

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:17.540
You're sure?

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:20.020
Mm...

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:29.460
Yum!

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:34.730
You eat the rest, okay, Yung?

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:55.280
Mister, you're different from the others.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:57.320
You mean Marlene and them?

00:16:58.360 --> 00:17:01.950
That's probably because I'm someone not from this era.

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:03.460
Huh?

00:17:03.530 --> 00:17:05.620
I was asleep a long time...

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:09.100
Since long before you were even born, Yung.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:12.630
I was full of hope for the future.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:18.650
But the future isn't all that bright a world, is it?

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:23.310
I wish Yung could go to sleep for a long time, too.

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:26.620
When you're asleep, even the Blue aren't scary, right?

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:39.930
Yung, don't worry. No matter what happens, I will protect you, Yung.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:40.930
Really?

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:55.510
There must be some way that I can help Yung...

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:56.950
There must be...

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:03.950
If we could contact the Station, we could send for a rescue party, couldn't we!?

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:08.860
Marlene said what she did, but if a rescue party were to come, then surely...

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:27.640
At a time like this, how can they...?

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:52.600
Robert, look at this.

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:55.610
There's a tower here with satellite circuitry.

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:58.410
We might be able to communicate with the Station from here.

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:01.940
Joey, get ready to depart!

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:02.950
Roger.

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:05.280
Yuji, you too.

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:06.010
Yeah.

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:12.920
If only a rescue party were to come, I could save Yung...

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:36.310
Hoo boy...

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:39.590
It's become one big Blue "Nesuto."

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:41.250
A "Nesuto?"

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:43.920
A nest, I mean, a nest. A Blue nest.

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.580
In that case...

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:49.290
We must contact the Station no matter what. Let's go!

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:15.820
What's this?

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:27.960
W- what are those?

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.560
They're Blue eggs.

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:34.670
It's hatching!

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:44.580
It has no core!

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:47.920
No, it's under the skin!

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:54.920
You mean it's shielding its core!?

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:57.660
These things are definitely evolving.

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:39.220
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:45.350
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:47.560 --> 00:21:54.500
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:54.620 --> 00:22:00.670
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:07.090
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:14.280
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:19.440
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:25.500
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:25.800 --> 00:22:31.780
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:32.390 --> 00:22:39.260
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:46.120
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:52.830
What's a Sunday?

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:55.840
Are they fun?

00:22:55.870 --> 00:23:00.830
Will I be able to play with my father and mother again?

00:23:00.870 --> 00:23:05.830
I wish Yung could've slept a long time too, like you did, Mister.

00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:10.410
After all, when you're asleep, the Blue aren't that scary, right?

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:12.280
Yung!!
